      <figcaption><span class="fignum">Fig. 1</span>The review screen, and the whole argument of the product in one layout. The source document stays on the left so a reviewer can check any figure against it; the four pipeline stages report down the right in the order they ran; the proposed status, sub-status and notification sit above the only button that does anything irreversible.</figcaption>
